  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Detail Panel & Audit Trail",
      "id": "detail-panel",
      "intro": "Setiap template pesan memiliki Detail Panel yang meluncur dari kanan layar saat item dipilih. Panel ini memisahkan ringkasan data umum dengan catatan audit (History) guna memudahkan monitoring.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tab General: Metadata & Isi Konten",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik salah satu card atau row di daftar template untuk memunculkan Detail Panel.\n• Tab **General** menampilkan card modular berisi:\n  - **Template ID**: ID unik penanda sistem.\n  - **Template Name**: Nama template.\n  - **Platform**: Media komunikasi (Email/Telegram/WhatsApp).\n  - **Subject**: Subjek judul pesan.\n• **Template Content**: Menampilkan body text asli template dalam box bergaya monospace bergaris putus-putus untuk memvalidasi posisi parameter placeholder.\n• Tombol **Edit Template** dan **Delete Template** tersedia di pojok kanan atas untuk pemrosesan cepat data.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(37,99,235,.1);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#2563eb;border:1px solid #2563eb;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">History</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(37,99,235,0.1);font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.15);\">✏ Edit Template</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;display:grid;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.02);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"background:#dbeafe;color:#2563eb;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;\">●</span><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;\">Template ID</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.02);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;\">💬</span><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;\">Platform</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Email</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.02);grid-column:span 2;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"background:#ffedd5;color:#c2410c;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;\">📋</span><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;\">Subject</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert: Suspicious Tx &lt;hpan&gt;</div></div></div><div style=\"border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;background:#fafafa;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;color:#334155;\">Halo Admin, terjadi transaksi bernilai Rp &lt;amount&gt; menggunakan kartu &lt;hpan&gt;. Segera verifikasi.</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab History: Audit Log & Fullscreen Timeline",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **History** merekam riwayat audit perubahan data secara kronologis dari yang terbaru.\n• Informasi mencakup:\n  - **Initiator**: Email user administrator pembuat perubahan.\n  - **Timestamp**: Waktu eksekusi aksi.\n  - **Change Log**: Penjelasan nilai properti sebelum dan sesudah diubah.\n• Klik tombol **Expand Timeline** di pojok kanan atas untuk memunculkan modal popup fullscreen yang memuat visual audit trail secara lebih longgar dan komparatif.",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(124,58,237,.12);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #7c3aed;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">History</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(124,58,237,0.15);font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;\">Expand Timeline</span></div><div style=\"padding:14px;\"><div style=\"position:relative;padding-left:16px;border-left:2px solid #e9d5ff;margin-left:6px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-5px;top:2px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span>admin@system.com</span><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;font-weight:500;\">10 mins ago</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Edited template subject and body content.</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;background:#dcfce7;color:#16a34a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">✓ SUCCESS</div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-5px;top:66px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#a78bfa;\"></div><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span>system_job</span><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;font-weight:500;\">2 days ago</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Created initial message template.</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Perbedaan Detail: Card View vs Table View",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Card View (Drawer):** Detail panel tampil sebagai slide-in drawer kanan yang menutupi sebagian konten. Cocok untuk visualisasi berukuran sedang-besar dan memiliki tombol *Expand Timeline*.\n• **Table View (Fixed Sidebar):** Detail panel tampil tersemat sebagai sidebar permanen dengan lebar tetap `22rem` di sisi kanan layar.\n• **Komparasi Nilai (History):** Khusus pada Table View, ketika terjadi operasi pengeditan data (`Update`), audit log menyajikan dropdown Accordion **Previous Value** (nilai lama) dan **New Value** (nilai baru) secara terperinci guna memperlihatkan pembandingan nilai field yang dimodifikasi secara real-time.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(16,185,129,.12);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#f0fdf4;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#15803d;\">Table Details - History</div></div><div style=\"padding:14px;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;margin-bottom:6px;\">Update message template details</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #fee2e2;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#fef2f2;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span>Previous Value</span><span>▼</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-size:8px;color:#7f1d1d;font-family:monospace;background:#fff;\">subject: Old Subject</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span>New Value</span><span>▼</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-size:8px;color:#1e3a8a;font-family:monospace;background:#fff;\">subject: New Tx Alert</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
